  "rationale": "Only one column is present. It offers a comparative-positioning axis that is somewhat generic and misaligned with the query's focus on distinct aspects of food quality, giving limited analytical leverage. More critically, several sampled values assert comparisons to alternatives that the source text does not support (taffy, peanuts, confection), indicating recurring hallucination, though the appropriate 'Unknown' for the silent row is handled correctly."
}

